{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"VPS Terminal - Dev","version":"0.6.0","description":"DEV-only isolated VPS Terminal Action for testing the current mediation, guidance, approval, learning and runtime contracts without using the production Action. Bounded target-aware terminal, Docker inventory/diagnostics, lifecycle locks, evidence-gated mutation transactions, and live-runtime file API for GPT Actions. Container inventory supports response-budgeted snapshot cursor pagination across running and stopped states. Container execution is bounded argv-only through the guarded Docker path. Runtime file editing is opt-in per logical target, stale-safe by SHA-256, root-bounded, and verified by readback. Coolify mutation itself remains outside VPS Terminal; VPS Terminal supplies locking, baseline, verification, commit and rollback evidence gates. Git publication is not exposed."},"servers":[{"url":"https://vps-terminal-dev.srv1904412.hstgr.cloud"}],"security":[{"Bearer":[]}],"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"operationId":"health","summary":"Check VPS Terminal liveness","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/ready":{"get":{"operationId":"ready","summary":"Check VPS Terminal and Docker readiness","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"},"503":{"description":"Not ready"}}}},"/api/v1/version":{"get":{"operationId":"version","summary":"Read service version information","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK"}}}},"/v1/target/file":{"get":{"operationId":"readTargetFile","summary":"Read a bounded UTF-8 file range from an allowlisted live target root with SHA-256 evidence","parameters":[{"name":"target_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":128,"description":"Registered static target id. Live file operations do not accept debug:<uuid> targets."}},{"name":"path","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":512},"description":"Absolute path inside target live_patch_roots."},{"na